# Local development override — only needed when running `npm run dev` directly
# (i.e. NOT using `vercel dev`).
#
# When deployed on Vercel, or when using `vercel dev`, leave this unset.
# The Vercel rewrite `/api/(.*)` → backend service handles routing automatically.
#
# When running `npm run dev` + Flask separately, set this to the Flask port:
# VITE_API_BASE=http://localhost:5001
